# Level 17, reached by password, then a *second weapon* picked up and fired.
#
# **This is the first input in the project that fires anything but the squirt
# gun**, and it is what the coverage table has been asking for since the level-29
# round. Every shot in every earlier movie carries collision id $5C, which is why
# `enemy_hit_special` -- the branch each of the eight copies of $81:8888 keeps for
# ids $5D and $5E -- had read zero on every input ever recorded.
#
# The route is four moves, because level 17 puts an object of type $02 sixty-four
# pixels from where the player starts. `zamn_assets actors <rom> 18` lists it at
# (220,431) and `zamn_assets route <rom> 18 284 420 220 431` walks there in ten
# cells: Left is blocked at x=242, so it is Left, Down, Left. Object type $02 is
# collision id $0D ($80:CA30), which is inventory slot 1, and B cycles the
# selection to it ($80:EA63). From then on every shot on screen reads $5D --
# checked with `--records`, not assumed.
#
# What it buys: `enemy_hit_special` 333, `shot_expire` 25, and a census entry of
# $81:847E, the routine the whole family hands $5D to and that nothing had ever
# reached.
#
# Retune by watching where it actually gets to:
#   zamn_headless <rom> shot.png 4700 -m movies\level17-weapon.zmv --records 2560,2760,200
